### ============================================================================
### AUTH
### ============================================================================

### Verificar status (existe admin?)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/status

### Setup inicial (cria primeiro admin - falha se já existe)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/setup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Administrador",
  "email": "admin@agendafacil.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@agendafacil.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Perfil do admin logado
GET http://localhost:3001/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Esqueci a senha
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@agendafacil.com"
}

### Redefinir senha (use o token retornado no log do backend)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "TOKEN_DO_LOG",
  "password": "novasenha123"
}

### ============================================================================
### CATEGORIES
### ============================================================================

### Listar categorias
GET http://localhost:3001/api/categories

### Criar categoria
POST http://localhost:3001/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "name": "Corte de Cabelo",
  "description": "Serviços de corte e styling"
}

### ============================================================================
### PROFESSIONALS
### ============================================================================

### Listar profissionais
GET http://localhost:3001/api/professionals

### Listar profissionais por categoria
GET http://localhost:3001/api/professionals/category/CATEGORIA_ID_AQUI

### Criar profissional
POST http://localhost:3001/api/professionals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "name": "João Silva",
  "phone": "11999999999",
  "categoryId": "CATEGORIA_ID_AQUI",
  "address": "Rua das Flores, 123"
}

### ============================================================================
### AVAILABILITIES
### ============================================================================

### Criar disponibilidade (dia 1 = segunda, 09:00 às 18:00)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/availabilities
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

{
  "professionalId": "PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI",
  "dayOfWeek": 1,
  "startTime": "09:00",
  "endTime": "18:00"
}

### Obter horários disponíveis
GET http://localhost:3001/api/availabilities/slots?professionalId=PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI&date=2027-03-20

### ============================================================================
### APPOINTMENTS
### ============================================================================

### Criar agendamento (público)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionalId": "PROFISSIONAL_ID_AQUI",
  "clientName": "Maria Santos",
  "clientPhone": "11988887777",
  "date": "2027-03-20T14:00:00-03:00"
}

### Listar agendamentos (paginado)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments?page=1&pageSize=20&sortBy=date&order=asc
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Listar apenas pendentes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Filtrar por data
GET http://localhost:3001/api/appointments?dateFrom=2027-03-20T00:00:00-03:00&dateTo=2027-03-20T23:59:59-03:00
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Confirmar agendamento
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/APPOINTMENT_ID_AQUI/confirm
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### Cancelar agendamento
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/appointments/APPOINTMENT_ID_AQUI/cancel
Authorization: Bearer TOKEN_AQUI

### ============================================================================
### HEALTH
### ============================================================================

### Healthcheck geral
GET http://localhost:3001/health

### Healthcheck do banco
GET http://localhost:3001/health/database

### Healthcheck da Evolution
GET http://localhost:3001/health/evolution

### ============================================================================
### DOCS
### ============================================================================

### Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:3001/api/docs

### OpenAPI spec (JSON)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/docs/openapi.json
